      "value": "This would be extremely useful. Especially if there is a way to somehow also list them by how active they are. Because a LOT of groups are nothing but filler tbh. So making groups that have instances often also take priority would be a lot of help. You could make it like a tagging system of said interests, and another tag of “active group”",
