  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There should be a button on the UI, similar to \"Represent Group\", called something like \"Pin to Profile\".\n\nRight now with the new profile design, a user's represented group, along with the first four groups, sorted by alphabetical order, are displayed.\n\nThis is frustrating, as:\n\n1.  The groups displayed change based on if the user's membership to those groups is set to Public, Friends or Hidden, or Hidden but the user looking at the profile shares groups with the user they are inspecting.\n\n2. Users can't actually see what their own profile looks like to other users, since regardless of visibility settings, they'll always see the first four (or five if no group is represented) groups they are a part of in alphabetical order.",
